   $q$What is the purpose of the transition "Meanwhile, at home" in sentence 6?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It signals a second plot line happening at the same time in a different place.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It introduces an event that happened many years before the story.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-time-order"},{"text":"It shows that the narrator has left the archive and gone home.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-setting-shift"},{"text":"It explains that the grandfather caused the narrator to visit the archive.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-cause-effect"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It signals a second plot line happening at the same time in a different place.$q$, $q$"Meanwhile" tells the reader that the grandfather's sorting happens while the narrator reads ledgers, setting up two plot lines that later meet. The narrator is still at the archive, as sentence 8 shows.$q$, 'draft', '6b9a61da-4ab9-5ad9-ac8e-12baaac7183d')
